<title>SWEDEN: Nordbanken, Post cooperation approved.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken, Post cooperation approved.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish competition authority said on Tuesday it approved a cooperation between state-controlled bank Nordbanken and the Post Office's giro services, the Postgirot.</p>
<p>&quot;The cooperation on giro services between Postgirot and Nordbanken is allowed according to the competition law,&quot; the competition authority, Knokurrensverket, said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Through the cooperation consumers get better access to giro services.&quot;</p>
<p>The deal is mainly technical with prices and conditions set by Nordbanken and Postgirot separately, the authority said.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
